			<p class="block-hero__top-title">Business Lines</p><h1 class="block-hero__title"><em>Equity Research &amp; Brokerage</em><br />
</h1><div class="block-hero__description">Enabling clients to find the best opportunities through our unique expertise in European equity markets</div><div class="block-hero__button"><a target="_blank" href="https://www.securities.oddo-bhf.com/#login" class="btn-secondary-reverse" rel="noopener"><span class="sr-only">New window</span>Research website access</a></div>		</div>
